QH9i_uSB2OZUx8PFW5W9ep074iYNNNLyRhoqprZI1Nkag&oe=6A83039F"}, {"file_name": "screen1.png", "id": "143470387595693", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003242_143470394262359_7112974016275905666_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r8j4Ib-mJKIQ7kNvwHv6Zwj&_nc_oc=Adr9uueRNiAGHM3cNSW5_5NUUL7YJ8_rSLeLcKKz_CdMaQzX0rkw2Z8lfe4qgUz9BP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHnO5SwJpo9KIWjremGcH5R6ywTOvKha3Jzn9GdQSSsUg&oe=6A8316B7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Australian Open VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Who says the best seats in the house are court side?  The Australian Open VR app gives you unprecedented access to the very center of tennis action: the Rod Laver Arena. \n\nWith this app, you get:\n- Immersive multi-camera action from the Rod Laver Arena for all matches.\n- An interactive \"Director's Chair\" , where you get to select the best camera from the AO2021 Rod Laver Arena TV production to follow the action the way you like it.\n- Highlights and featured content for the tournament.\n\nContent available only for users in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9pDkUveRMIsQ7kNvwGoOdmQ&_nc_oc=Adrd0ni3q8M7lYpUDS_CH2HHWJGBqgblMXQENEe35BwpBB4PP7GBcF1haD4QHtLCX2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHknbFIqH2c0Lm1vUrCJehtGVJ8NY_XLu3KWPrcIoDb0A&oe=6A82FB39"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5